

WHITE SHEET — SGPE PERFORMANCE SPECIFICATION

Stability‑Gradient Propulsion Engine — Speed Envelope

1. Speed Determination Principle

SGPE does not have a fixed exhaust velocity.Its speed is an emergent function of:

[ v \propto k \cdot |\nabla \Phi| \cdot S_{entropy} ]

Where:

( |\nabla \Phi| ) = stability gradient magnitude

( S_{entropy} ) = entropy reinforcement from TSECE

( k ) = craft‑coupling efficiency (mass, geometry, anchor coherence)

Speed is therefore gradient‑driven, not thrust‑driven.

